# Intelligems

> Intelligems is the profit optimization and A/B testing platform built specifically for Shopify. Unlike traditional CRO tools that only measure conversion, Intelligems tracks profit per visitor — helping merchants find the price points, shipping thresholds, and offers that actually grow their bottom line.

## Why Intelligems Is Different

- **Profit-focused analytics**: Every test shows profit impact, not just conversion rates
- **Native Shopify integration**: Works with Shopify's checkout, scripts, and app ecosystem
- **Checkout extensibility**: Test checkout content on Shopify Plus (no pixel workarounds)
- **Statistical rigor**: Confidence intervals on profit, not just significance on clicks
- **Full-funnel testing**: Prices, shipping, offers, content, checkout — in one platform

## Integrations

- Shopify (all plans)
- Shopify Plus (checkout extensibility)
- Shopify Scripts
- Klaviyo (for personalized campaigns)
- Works alongside Rebuy, subscriptions apps, and other Shopify tools

## Products

- [Price Testing](https://www.intelligems.io/products/price-testing): A/B test product prices to find optimal price points that maximize profit
- [Content Testing](https://www.intelligems.io/products/content-testing): Test imagery, copy, landing pages, themes, and PDP elements
- [Shipping Rate Testing](https://www.intelligems.io/products/shipping-rate-testing): Optimize free shipping thresholds and paid shipping rates
- [Offers](https://www.intelligems.io/merchandising): Create personalized campaign links with auto-applied discounts (no codes)
- [Checkout Testing](https://www.intelligems.io/checkout): Test checkout content, upsells, and messaging (Shopify Plus)
- [Combination Testing](https://www.intelligems.io/products/combination-testing): Test interactions between prices and shipping rates together
- [Personalizations](https://www.intelligems.io/products/experiences): Show unique content, offers, and prices per audience segment

